# The enters trigger is independent of its source (CR 603.3, 608.2): Bot2 sacrifices its Strip Mine to destroy Bot1's Adventurer's
# Inn in response to the trigger, and the trigger still resolves, so Bot1 gains 2 life although the Inn is in the graveyard.
# Bot2's Strip Mine is played on turn 2 and Bot1 plays the Inn on turn 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Adventurer's Inn
Plains x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Strip Mine
Plains x19

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Strip Mine.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Adventurer's Inn.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Strip Mine.Activate(Ability: Destroy target land; Bot1.Battlefield.Adventurer's Inn)
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 22
Bot1.Graveyard = Adventurer's Inn
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Strip Mine
Stack.Count = 0
